From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 11:41:05 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] add WPE WebKit lightweight browser for wearables
 (overlay/wpewebkit)

This patch integrates the lightweight WPE WebKit rendering engine and browser:

- overlay/wpewebkit: WPE WebKit build definition tuned for low RAM usage
  and OpenGL ES acceleration on wearable GPUs.
- overlay/asteroidos/wpewebkit-qt: Qt 6 bindings and QML view components.
- overlay/asteroidos/browser: Minimalist touch-optimized browser with
  captive portal helper and kinetic touch scrolling.
- overlay/asteroidos/default.nix: Exposes browser and wpewebkit-qt in asteroid scope.
- overlay/overlay.nix: Registers wpewebkit package in Nixpkgs overlay.
